  "P0030": {"title":"HO2S Heater Control Circuit (Bank 1 Sensor 1)","causes":"Oxygen-sensor heater, fuse, wiring, or connector fault.","symptoms":"Check-engine light; emissions or fuel economy may worsen.","checks":"Inspect fuse and wiring; test heater resistance and supply per specification.","prevention":"Repair damaged wiring and use correct replacement parts.","note":"Generic reference description; verify against vehicle make/model/year and service information.","type":"generic","repair":"Fix leaks, wiring and connector faults first; replace a sensor or component only after it fails testing. Repair only what testing confirms (wiring, connector, leak or failed part), then clear the code and verify with a road test and live data."},
